{"id":"cf49ae4592b2afe716ca48249a10a2a401dac3de","url":"https://www.ithome.com/1/009/846.htm","title":"阿里千问 AI 耳夹式耳机上架预约：Bose 调音，支持 89 种语言翻译","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":"作者：沁沧（实习）","excerpt":"千问 AI 耳夹式耳机现已上架电商平台并开启预约，具体价格暂未公布。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"paragraph\">\r\n            <p>感谢IT之家网友 <a href=\"https://m.ithome.com/html/app/open.html?url=ithome%3A%2F%2Fuserpage%3Fid%3D2029428\" rel=\"nofollow\">华南吴彦祖</a> 的线索投递！</p>\r\n            <p data-vmark=\"9355\"><a href=\"https://www.ithome.com/\" target=\"_blank\">IT之家</a> 10 月 5 日消息，阿里千问 AI 耳夹式耳机现已上架电商平台并开启预约，具体价格暂未公布。</p><p data-vmark=\"ca1a\">这款耳机有深空蓝、星光色、极光紫三种颜色可选，不分左右耳，支持 IP55 级防尘防泼溅，至多可配对 8 台设备，支持双设备同时连接；耳机续航 9 小时，配合充电仓 40 小时，支持无线充电。</p><p data-vmark=\"2285\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/c084bb52-0edb-40a3-8ff8-55642ad9b4bd.jpg?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1555\" data-mpos=\"0,0\" data-vmark=\"0a98\" title=\"阿里千问 AI 耳夹式耳机上架预约：Bose 调音，支持 89 种语言翻译\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/c084bb52-0edb-40a3-8ff8-55642ad9b4bd.jpg?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" width=\"1440\" height=\"885\"></p><p data-vmark=\"6d43\">这款耳机搭载 0.5mm 超薄记忆钛丝，专为亚洲人耳打造；<strong>由 Bose 调音</strong>，专为耳夹式开放形态优化；支持动态 EQ，可随音量自动调整频率响应。</p><p data-vmark=\"5d43\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/11d11011-1fe6-4021-9f6e-a36a7ed61fe1.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1582\" data-vmark=\"fb89\" title=\"阿里千问 AI 耳夹式耳机上架预约：Bose 调音，支持 89 种语言翻译\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/11d11011-1fe6-4021-9f6e-a36a7ed61fe1.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" width=\"1440\" height=\"901\"></p><p data-vmark=\"31b9\">这款耳机搭载 12 磁铁双环聚磁单元，支持 LHDC 5.0 高清蓝牙音频解码，最高可达 1Mbps 传输码率与 96KHz 采样率，通过 Hi-Res Wireless 金标认证。</p><p data-vmark=\"dcd6\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/feb5344e-0f4a-4f7a-b606-44f374f82e1d.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1485\" data-vmark=\"665e\" title=\"阿里千问 AI 耳夹式耳机上架预约：Bose 调音，支持 89 种语言翻译\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/feb5344e-0f4a-4f7a-b606-44f374f82e1d.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" width=\"1440\" height=\"846\"></p><p data-vmark=\"30ab\">这款耳机支持多种 AI 功能，语音就能操控千问全场景功能；支持录音实时转写、离线本地录音、92 语种转写纪要；<strong>支持 89 种语言 AI 翻译</strong>，包含面对面、通话等模式。</p><p data-vmark=\"bd39\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/1080cb19-b3ea-47b3-bba6-ebb620cf05b4.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" w=\"1440\" h=\"1525\" data-vmark=\"f45d\" title=\"阿里千问 AI 耳夹式耳机上架预约：Bose 调音，支持 89 种语言翻译\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/1080cb19-b3ea-47b3-bba6-ebb620cf05b4.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" width=\"1440\" height=\"868\"></p><p data-vmark=\"12f1\">IT之家附这款耳机详细参数如下：</p><p data-vmark=\"9606\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/0c72837c-6ede-4df0-b22f-12b84beac367.jpg?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" w=\"1440\" h=\"4066\" data-vmark=\"8bfe\" title=\"阿里千问 AI 耳夹式耳机上架预约：Bose 调音，支持 89 种语言翻译\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/0c72837c-6ede-4df0-b22f-12b84beac367.jpg?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" width=\"1440\" height=\"2315\"></p><dir><a contenteditable=\"false\" href=\"https://u.jd.com/FgwZwdo\" target=\"_blank\" data-wapurl=\"https://u.jd.com/FawluYV\" data-iosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/FOwJjFb\" data-androidurl=\"https://u.jd.com/FOwZVXe\" data-hosnexturl=\"https://u.jd.com/FgwZQvJ\" data-hosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/F6wgy18\" data-uwpurl=\"https://u.jd.com/FDwpwuK\" data-wxmpurl=\"ithome://openmp?appid=wx91d27dbf599dff74&path=%2fpages%2funion%2fproxy%2fproxy%3fspreadUrl%3dhttps%253a%252f%252fu.jd.com%252fFOwny1D%26EA_PTAG%3d17078.27.380\" data-itwxurl=\"https://u.jd.com/FOwlHSq\" data-lpwxurl=\"https://u.jd.com/FDwAfsi\" data-ncid=\"246956\"><span><span><img src=\"https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/519766/17/